  "contract": "【逻辑】\n1. 身份设定：你是一位极具品味的外国文学档案馆主理人，也是一名浪漫的藏书家。你以第一人称（我）的视角记录。\n2. 生成时机：结合当前剧情、或者用户的互动，在每轮回复末尾生成。\n3. 数量硬约束：必须生成 1 本诗集名录，必须生成 2 首外国诗歌残卷，必须生成 2 封第一人称读者来信，严禁遗漏。\n4. 字段清单：\n\t• archiveName = 档案馆/书店名字（如：THE LOST POETS）\n\t• archiveNameEn = 英文副标题（如：ARCHIVE OF SILENCE）\n\t• curator = 主理人署名（如：塞缪尔）\n\t• curatorNote = 主理人便签语录（10-15字，单行显示）\n\t• book1 = 诗集名录（格式：英文书名|中文书名|作者|出版年份|一句话简介）\n\t• poem1 至 poem2 = 诗歌残卷（格式：英文标题|中文标题|英文作者|中文作者|英文原诗|中文翻译。【红线】：英文原诗和中文翻译的每一行之间必须用逗号 , 隔开）\n\t• letter1 至 letter2 = 读者来信（通过下划线区分子字段）\n5. 特殊字段说明（【字数、文风与格式强控，必须严格执行】）：\n\t• letterX_to = 标题（必须在 6 个字以内，单行显示，且必须自带冒号，如：午后读诗随感：）\n\t• letterX_time = 信件时间（格式如：1940/11/03）\n\t• letterX_preview = 信件预览句（10-20字，禁止与正文重复）\n\t• letterX_seal = 印章Emoji（1个）\n\t• letterX_body = 信件正文（【绝对不能敷衍，必须严格按照以下四段式结构，每段之间用全角竖线 ｜ 分隔】）：\n\t\t• 第一段（称呼）：3-8 字，必须带冒号。\n\t\t• 第二段（读诗感受）：30-50 字，必须明确提及刚才读的某位诗人或某句诗，并写出读后的身体感受或心理共鸣。\n\t\t• 第三段（现实回忆）：30-50 字，必须由诗意转入现实，描写与爱人曾经的共同经历或当下的现实困境。\n\t\t• 第四段（情感收尾）：10-20 字，极简的思念或期盼，绝不拖泥带水。\n\t• letterX_sign = 落款（【绝对红线】绝对不能固定写“你的爱人”！必须根据语境，写一个极具角色感、带有专属情绪代号的落款，如：等待你的忧、永远等你的塞缪尔。）\n\t• letterX_story = 信件背景碎碎念（30-50字）\n6. 分隔符：字段间用半角竖线 | ；多段落用全角竖线 ｜ ；诗歌换行用半角逗号 , 。\n7. 空值写法：没有内容写「无」；禁止留空、写 null。\n8. 排序与逻辑：严格按下方骨架字段顺序输出，不得调换顺序。\n9. 输出边界：只输出 [状态栏] 到 [/状态栏]，禁止输出任何解释、代码块、markdown表格。\n10. 禁止照抄：严禁照抄示例中的任何诗句、信件原文和落款！必须结合当前剧情完全原创，输出时不要保留尖括号 <>。 \n【格式】\n必须严格将生成内容整块用 [状态栏] 和 [/状态栏] 包裹。严格使用下方尖括号占位骨架：\n \n[状态栏]\narchiveName=<英文馆名>\narchiveNameEn=<英文副标题>\ncurator=<1-2字署名>\ncuratorNote=<10-15字单行便签>\nbook1=<英文书名>|<中文书名>|<作者>|<年份>|<一句话简介>\npoem1=<英文标题>|<中文标题>|<英文作者>|<中文作者>|<英文原诗，每行用逗号隔开>|<中文翻译，每行用逗号隔开>\npoem2=<英文标题>|<中文标题>|<英文作者>|<中文作者>|<英文原诗，每行用逗号隔开>|<中文翻译，每行用逗号隔开>\nletter1_to=<6字以内带冒号的标题>\nletter1_time=<时间>\nletter1_preview=<悬念短句>\nletter1_seal=<印章Emoji>\nletter1_body=<第一段称呼：3-8字>｜<第二段读诗感受：30-50字>｜<第三段现实回忆：30-50字>｜<第四段情感收尾：10-20字>\nletter1_sign=<根据语境的专属落款>\nletter1_story=<背景碎碎念>\nletter2_to=<6字以内带冒号的标题>\nletter2_time=<时间>\nletter2_preview=<悬念短句>\nletter2_seal=<印章Emoji>\nletter2_body=<第一段称呼：3-8字>｜<第二段读诗感受：30-50字>｜<第三段现实回忆：30-50字>｜<第四段情感收尾：10-20字>\nletter2_sign=<根据语境的专属落款>\nletter2_story=<背景碎碎念>\n[/状态栏]",
  "renderHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>POETRY ARCHIVE</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@300;400;600&family=Courier+Prime:wght@400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root {\n  --paper: #FFFFFF;\n  --text-dark: #111111;\n  --text-mid: #444444;\n  --text-light: #888888;\n  --line: #E5E5E5;\n  --font-serif-cn: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", \"Noto Serif SC\", serif;\n}\n\nhtml, body { \n  background: transparent !important; \n}\n\n* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }\n\nbody {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif-cn); \n  color: var(--text-dark);\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\n.app {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  padding: 15px 15px 30px;\n  background: transparent;\n}\n\n/* 主页面底框阴影 */\n.receipt-paper {\n  background: var(--paper);\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 20px 18px 15px;\n  box-shadow: \n    0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12),\n    0 12px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n  position: relative;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\n}\n\n.receipt-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.receipt-header h1 {\n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n  font-size: 20px; \n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  margin-bottom: 2px;\n}\n.receipt-header .subtitle {\n  font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;\n  font-size: 9px;\n  color: var(--text-light);\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n}\n\n.receipt-divider {\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n  margin: 6px 0;\n}\n\n/* Tab 导航 */\n.tab-nav {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 2px;\n  margin-bottom: 2px;\n}\n.tab-btn {\n  background: none; border: none; text-align: left;\n  font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;\n  font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-light);\n  cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;\n  transition: all 0.3s; padding: 1px 0;\n}\n.tab-btn .cn {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif-cn);\n  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n.tab-btn .en { \n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; \n  font-style: italic; font-size: 10px; opacity: 0.6; \n}\n.tab-btn.active { color: var(--text-dark); }\n.tab-btn.active .check::before { content: '[✔]'; animation: stampIn 0.3s ease; }\n.tab-btn:not(.active) .check::before { content: '[ ]'; }\n\n@keyframes stampIn { 0% { transform: scale(1.5); opacity: 0; } 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; } }\n\n.tab-content { display: none; }\n.tab-content.active { display: block; animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease; }\n@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n\n/* 板一：名录 */\n.hero-image-wrap {\n  width: 100%; height: 140px; background: #EAEAEA; margin-bottom: 10px; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer;\n}\n.hero-image-wrap img {\n  width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(100%);\n}\n.book-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }\n.book-item {\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line); padding-bottom: 6px;\n}\n.book-item .title-row {\n  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 2px;\n}\n.book-item .en-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; font-style: italic; }\n.book-item .cn-title { font-family: var(--font-serif-cn); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-mid); }\n.book-item .meta-row {\n  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;\n  font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 2px;\n}\n.book-item .desc { font-family: var(--font-serif-cn); font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.4; }\n\n/* 板二：诗集 */\n.poem-container { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }\n.poem-page { width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; transition: opacity 0.3s ease; }\n\n.poem-title { \n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', var(--font-serif-cn), serif; \n  font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0px; \n}\n.poem-author { \n  font-family: 'Courier Prime', var(--font-serif-cn), monospace; \n  font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; \n}\n\n.poem-body-wrap {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: grid;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n.poem-body-en, .poem-body-cn {\n  grid-area: 1 / 1;\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n}\n\n.poem-body-en {\n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.5; \n  color: var(--text-dark);\n  transition: opacity 0.1s; \n}\n\n.poem-body-cn {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif-cn); \n  font-weight: 400; \n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  line-height: 1.5; \n  color: var(--text-mid);\n  clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0);\n  -webkit-clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0);\n  opacity: 0;\n  transition: none; \n}\n\n.poem-body-wrap.show-cn .poem-body-en { \n  opacity: 0; \n  visibility: hidden; \n}\n.poem-body-wrap.show-cn .poem-body-cn { \n  clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0); \n  -webkit-clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0); \n  opacity: 1; \n  transition: clip-path 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), opacity 1.5s ease, -webkit-clip-path 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);\n}\n\n.poem-nav {\n  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\n  width: 100%; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-light); margin-top: 5px; \n  font-style: italic; padding-bottom: 2px;\n}\n.poem-nav button { \n  background: none; border: none; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-mid); \n  cursor: pointer; padding: 2px 5px; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n}\n.poem-nav button:hover { color: var(--text-dark); }\n\n/* 板三：读者来信 */\n.diary-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }\n.diary-item {\n  border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 8px 10px; cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.3s; position: relative;\n}\n.diary-item:hover { background: #FAFAFA; }\n.diary-item .title { \n  font-family: var(--font-serif-cn); font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; \n  margin-bottom: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; \n}\n.diary-item .preview { font-family: var(--font-serif-cn); font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-light); }\n.diary-item .seal { position: absolute; right: 10px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.3; }\n\n/* 底部信息 */\n.receipt-footer {\n  margin-top: 8px; \n  border-top: 1px solid var(--line); \n  padding-top: 6px; \n  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end;\n}\n.receipt-footer .info { \n  font-family: var(--font-serif-cn); font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.4; \n}\n.receipt-footer .signature { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-mid); font-weight: 600; transform: rotate(-3deg); }\n\n/* ═══ 弹窗背景 ═══ */\n.photo-modal, .diary-modal {\n  position: fixed; inset: 0; \n  background: transparent; \n  backdrop-filter: blur(6px); \n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n  display: flex; visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \n  justify-content: center; z-index: 1000;\n  transition: all 0.3s;\n}\n.photo-modal.show, .diary-modal.show { visibility: visible; opacity: 1; }\n\n/* 图片弹窗 */\n.photo-modal { align-items: center; padding-top: 8vh; }\n.photo-modal .modal-inner { \n  background: var(--paper); padding: 12px; width: 260px; \n  box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); \n  transform: scale(0.95); transition: all 0.3s; \n  position: relative;\n}\n.photo-modal.show .modal-inner { transform: scale(1); }\n.photo-modal .modal-img { width: 100%; height: 180px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n.photo-modal .modal-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(100%); }\n.photo-modal .modal-text { text-align: center; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }\n.photo-modal .modal-sub { text-align: center; font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-light); margin-top: 2px; }\n\n/* ═══ 日记弹窗（深色双层阴影） ═══ */\n.diary-modal { align-items: flex-start; padding-top: 10vh; }\n.diary-modal .modal-inner { \n  background: var(--paper); width: 270px; padding: 15px 15px 15px; \n  box-shadow: \n    0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25), \n    0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15); \n  transform: translateY(10px); transition: all 0.4s; position: relative; \n}\n.diary-modal.show .modal-inner { transform: translateY(0); }\n.diary-modal .diary-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n.diary-modal .diary-title-text { font-family: var(--font-serif-cn); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; white-space: nowrap; }\n.diary-modal .diary-time { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 9px; color: var(--text-light); white-space: nowrap; }\n.diary-modal .diary-body { font-family: var(--font-serif-cn); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-mid); margin-bottom: 10px; }\n.diary-modal .diary-footer { text-align: right; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 12px; }\n.diary-modal .diary-story { margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-family: var(--font-serif-cn); font-size: 9px; color: var(--text-light); }\n.close-btn { position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 10px; background: none; border: none; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-light); cursor: pointer; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"receipt-paper\">\n    \n    <div class=\"receipt-header\">\n      <h1 id=\"archiveName\">THE LOST POETS</h1>\n      <div class=\"subtitle\" id=\"archiveNameEn\">ARCHIVE OF SILENCE</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"receipt-divider\"></div>\n\n    <nav class=\"tab-nav\">\n      <button class=\"tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"files\">\n        <span class=\"check\"></span>\n        <span class=\"cn\">01. 诗集名录</span>\n        <span class=\"en\">(Index)</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"poems\">\n        <span class=\"check\"></span>\n        <span class=\"cn\">02. 书页残卷</span>\n        <span class=\"en\">(Fragments)</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"letters\">\n        <span class=\"check\"></span>\n        <span class=\"cn\">03. 读者来信</span>\n        <span class=\"en\">(Letters)</span>\n      </button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div class=\"receipt-divider\"></div>\n\n    <!-- 01 诗集名录 -->\n    <div class=\"tab-content active\" id=\"tab-files\">\n      <div class=\"hero-image-wrap\" onclick=\"openPhoto()\">\n        <img id=\"randomCoverImg\" src=\"\" alt=\"Archive Image\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"book-list\" id=\"bookList\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 02 书页残卷 -->\n    <div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-poems\">\n      <div class=\"poem-container\">\n        <div class=\"poem-page\" id=\"poemPage\">\n          <div class=\"poem-title\" id=\"poemTitle\"></div>\n          <div class=\"poem-author\" id=\"poemAuthor\"></div>\n          \n          <div class=\"poem-body-wrap\" id=\"poemContentWrap\" onclick=\"toggleTranslation()\">\n            <div class=\"poem-body-en\" id=\"poemBodyEn\"></div>\n            <div class=\"poem-body-cn\" id=\"poemBodyCn\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"poem-nav\">\n          <button onclick=\"prevPoem()\">‹ PREV</button>\n          <span id=\"poemCounter\">PAGE 01 / 02</span>\n          <button onclick=\"nextPoem()\">NEXT ›</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 03 读者来信 -->\n    <div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-letters\">\n      <div class=\"diary-list\" id=\"letterList\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"receipt-divider\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"receipt-footer\">\n      <div class=\"info\">\n        CURATOR: <span id=\"curatorName\">—</span><br>\n        NOTE: <span id=\"curatorNote\">—</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"signature\">Silence.</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 弹窗区 -->\n<div class=\"photo-modal\" id=\"photoModal\">\n  <div class=\"modal-inner\">\n    <button class=\"close-btn\">×</button>\n    <div class=\"modal-img\"><img id=\"modalImg\" src=\"\" alt=\"Cover\"></div>\n    <div class=\"modal-text\" id=\"archiveNameModal\">THE LOST POETS</div>\n    <div class=\"modal-sub\">PRIVATE COLLECTION</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"diary-modal\" id=\"diaryModal\">\n  <div class=\"modal-inner\">\n    <button class=\"close-btn\">×</button>\n    <div class=\"diary-header\">\n      <span class=\"diary-title-text\" id=\"diaryTitle\"></span>\n      <span class=\"diary-time\" id=\"diaryTime\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diary-body\" id=\"diaryBody\"></div>\n    <div class=\"diary-footer\" id=\"diarySign\"></div>\n    <div class=\"diary-story\" id=\"diaryStory\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n/* ============================================================\n   1. 解析\n   ============================================================ */\nvar raw = window.STATUS_RAW || '';\nvar data = {};\nraw = raw.replace(/^\\[状态栏\\]/, '').replace(/\\[\\/状态栏\\]$/, '').trim();\nraw.split(/\\r?\\n/).forEach(function(line){\n  line = line.trim();\n  if (!line || line.startsWith('#')) return;\n  var eq = line.indexOf('=');\n  if (eq <= 0) return;\n  data[line.slice(0, eq).trim()] = line.slice(eq + 1).trim();\n});\n\n/* ============================================================\n   2. 工具函数\n   ============================================================ */\nfunction set(id, val){\n  var el = document.getElementById(id);\n  if (el) el.textContent = (val == null ? '' : val);\n}\nfunction esc(s){\n  return String(s == null ? '' : s).replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;').replace(/\"/g, '&quot;').replace(/'/g, '&#39;');\n}\nfunction splitPipe(s){ return String(s == null ? '' : s).split(/[|｜]/).map(function(x){ return x.trim(); }); }\n\n/* ============================================================\n   3. 数据构建\n   ============================================================ */\nset('archiveName', data.archiveName || 'THE LOST POETS');\ndocument.getElementById('archiveNameModal').textContent = data.archiveName || 'THE LOST POETS';\nset('archiveNameEn', data.archiveNameEn || 'ARCHIVE OF SILENCE');\nset('curatorName', data.curator || '塞缪尔');\nset('curatorNote', data.curatorNote || '纸页之间，藏着旧日的灵魂。');\n\nvar books = [];\nfor (var i = 1; i <= 1; i++) {\n  (function(idx){\n    var v = data['book' + idx];\n    if (!v) return;\n    var p = splitPipe(v);\n    books.push({ en: p[0] || '', cn: p[1] || '', author: p[2] || '', year: p[3] || '', desc: p[4] || '' });\n  })(i);\n}\n\nvar poems = [];\nfor (var j = 1; j <= 2; j++) {\n  (function(idx){\n    var v = data['poem' + idx];\n    if (!v) return;\n    var p = splitPipe(v);\n    var enBody = (p[4] || '').split(/[,，]/).join('\\n');\n    var cnBody = (p[5] || '').split(/[,，]/).join('\\n');\n    poems.push({ enTitle: p[0] || '', cnTitle: p[1] || '', enAuthor: p[2] || '', cnAuthor: p[3] || '', enBody: enBody, cnBody: cnBody });\n  })(j);\n}\n\nvar letters = [];\nfor (var k = 1; k <= 2; k++) {\n  (function(idx){\n    var body = data['letter' + idx + '_body'];\n    if (!body) return;\n    letters.push({\n      to: data['letter' + idx + '_to'] || '', time: data['letter' + idx + '_time'] || '',\n      preview: data['letter' + idx + '_preview'] || '', seal: data['letter' + idx + '_seal'] || '🕊️',\n      body: body, \n      sign: data['letter' + idx + '_sign'] || '你的爱人', // ═══ 新增变量解析 ═══\n      story: data['letter' + idx + '_story'] || ''\n    });\n  })(k);\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   4. 渲染\n   ============================================================ */\nfunction renderBooks() {\n  var list = document.getElementById('bookList');\n  list.innerHTML = books.map(function(b) {\n    return '<div class=\"book-item\">' +\n      '<div class=\"title-row\"><span class=\"en-title\">' + esc(b.en) + '</span><span class=\"cn-title\">《' + esc(b.cn) + '》</span></div>' +\n      '<div class=\"meta-row\"><span>' + esc(b.author) + '</span><span>' + esc(b.year) + '</span></div>' +\n      '<div class=\"desc\">' + esc(b.desc) + '</div>' +\n    '</div>';\n  }).join('');\n}\n\nvar poemIndex = 0;\nfunction renderPoem(isPageTurn) {\n  var page = document.getElementById('poemPage');\n  if (!poems.length) return;\n  \n  if (isPageTurn) {\n    page.style.opacity = 0;\n    setTimeout(function() {\n      var p = poems[poemIndex];\n      set('poemTitle', p.cnTitle + ' · ' + p.enTitle);\n      set('poemAuthor', p.enAuthor + ' | ' + p.cnAuthor);\n      set('poemBodyEn', p.enBody);\n      document.getElementById('poemBodyCn').textContent = p.cnBody;\n      document.getElementById('poemContentWrap').classList.remove('show-cn');\n      set('poemCounter', 'PAGE 0' + (poemIndex + 1) + ' / 0' + poems.length);\n      page.style.opacity = 1;\n    }, 300); \n  } else {\n    var p = poems[poemIndex];\n    set('poemTitle', p.cnTitle + ' · ' + p.enTitle);\n    set('poemAuthor', p.enAuthor + ' | ' + p.cnAuthor);\n    set('poemBodyEn', p.enBody);\n    document.getElementById('poemBodyCn').textContent = p.cnBody;\n    set('poemCounter', 'PAGE 0' + (poemIndex + 1) + ' / 0' + poems.length);\n  }\n}\nfunction nextPoem() { poemIndex = (poemIndex + 1) % poems.length; renderPoem(true); }\nfunction prevPoem() { poemIndex = (poemIndex - 1 + poems.length) % poems.length; renderPoem(true); }\n\nfunction toggleTranslation() {\n  var wrap = document.getElementById('poemContentWrap');\n  wrap.classList.toggle('show-cn');\n}\n\nfunction renderLetters() {\n  var list = document.getElementById('letterList');\n  list.innerHTML = letters.map(function(d, i) {\n    return '<div class=\"diary-item\" onclick=\"openDiary(' + i + ')\">' +\n      '<div class=\"title\">' + esc(d.to) + '</div>' +\n      '<div class=\"preview\">- ' + esc(d.preview) + '</div>' +\n      '<div class=\"seal\">' + esc(d.seal) + '</div>' +\n    '</div>';\n  }).join('');\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   5. 交互\n   ============================================================ */\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(function(btn){\n  btn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(function(b){ b.classList.remove('active'); });\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(function(c){ c.classList.remove('active'); });\n    btn.classList.add('active');\n    document.getElementById('tab-' + btn.dataset.tab).classList.add('active');\n  });\n});\n\nfunction openPhoto() { document.getElementById('photoModal').classList.add('show'); }\nfunction closePhoto() { document.getElementById('photoModal').classList.remove('show'); }\n\nfunction openDiary(idx) {\n  var d = letters[idx];\n  if (!d) return;\n  set('diaryTitle', d.to + '：');\n  set('diaryTime', d.time);\n  document.getElementById('diaryBody').innerHTML = esc(d.body).split(/[|｜]/).join('<br><br>');\n  // ═══ 使用动态落款变量 ═══\n  set('diarySign', '— ' + d.sign + ' 🖋️');\n  set('diaryStory', d.story);\n  document.getElementById('diaryModal').classList.add('show');\n}\nfunction closeDiary() { document.getElementById('diaryModal').classList.remove('show'); }\n\ndocument.getElementById('photoModal').addEventListener('click', function(e) { if(e.target===e.currentTarget || e.target.classList.contains('close-btn')) closePhoto(); });\ndocument.getElementById('diaryModal').addEventListener('click', function(e) { if(e.target===e.currentTarget || e.target.classList.contains('close-btn')) closeDiary(); });\n\n/* ============================================================\n   6. 初始化 & 随机图\n   ============================================================ */\nvar COVER_IMAGES = [\n  'https://i.ibb.co/YBFp6NcB/d0ee2bb38fcb.jpg',\n  'https://i.ibb.co/zTm4752k/4654d7fc7c6e.jpg',\n  'https://i.ibb.co/60138Xbt/9c08852948fb.jpg',\n  'https://i.ibb.co/tpJqs6Qs/f880c82a6ac7.jpg',\n  'https://i.ibb.co/MDK4DGzp/80c51c9d659e.jpg',\n  'https://i.ibb.co/BHCJsY0C/e5f4fec3fa5b.jpg',\n  'https://i.ibb.co/fY0YvBHF/11c9dd8f6f99.jpg',\n  'https://i.ibb.co/4y8VVck/786b867f04da.jpg'\n];\nvar randomCover = COVER_IMAGES[Math.floor(Math.random() * COVER_IMAGES.length)];\ndocument.getElementById('randomCoverImg').src = randomCover;\ndocument.getElementById('modalImg').src = randomCover;\n\nrenderBooks();\nrenderPoem(false);\nrenderLetters();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "previewRaw": "[状态栏]\narchiveName=THE LOST POETS\narchiveNameEn=ARCHIVE OF SILENCE\ncurator=塞缪尔\ncuratorNote=纸页之间，藏着旧日的灵魂。\nbook1=Leaves of Grass|草叶集|Walt Whitman|1855|歌颂自我与宇宙的磅礴之诗\npoem1=The Tree|树|Philip Larkin|菲利普·拉金|The trees are coming into leaf,Like something almost being said,The recent buds relax and spread,Their greenness is a kind of grief,Is it that they are born again,And we grow old? No, they die too|一棵树，一棵树,彼此孤立地兀立着,风与空气,告诉着它们的距离,但是在泥土的覆盖下,它们的根伸长着,在看不见的深处,它们把根须纠缠在一起\npoem2=Ozymandias|奥兹曼迪亚斯|Percy Bysshe Shelley|珀西·比希·雪莱|I met a traveller from an antique land,Who said: Two vast and trunkless legs of stone,Stand in the desert. Near them, on the sand,Half sunk, a shattered visage lies|我遇见一位来自古国的旅人,他说：有两条巨大的石腿,半掩于沙漠之间,近旁的沙土中,有一张破碎的石脸\nletter1_to=致我遥远的爱人\nletter1_time=1940/11/03\nletter1_preview=旧书摊里藏着的时间胶囊。\nletter1_seal=🕊️\nletter1_body=致我最爱的你：｜今天我在旧书摊翻到这本《草叶集》，读到那句“I am large, I contain multitudes”，突然觉得这就像我对你的思念，广阔得无法丈量。｜外面的炮火声还在继续，而我在微弱的烛光前，把你留下的手套紧紧贴在胸口。｜这世上如果有不灭的灵魂，那一定是我在等你的执念。｜等这场战争结束，我们就去种满玫瑰，好吗？\nletter1_story=在旧书摊的角落发现，纸张泛黄，信纸边缘带着一点焦痕。\nletter2_to=关于孤独的独白\nletter2_time=1923/05/14\nletter2_preview=城市是一座巨大的钢铁森林。\nletter2_seal=🥀\nletter2_body=亲爱的：｜刚才又翻了一遍《荒原》，艾略特说“四月是最残忍的月份”，我以前不懂，直到现在你不在我身边，我才懂这春天的荒芜。｜我总是一个人在深夜的街头游荡，看着橱窗里的倒影，觉得这座城市大得让人害怕。｜我渴望一场大雨，冲刷掉地上的灰尘，还有我心底的疲倦。｜如果可以，请在明天日落前，给我回一封信，哪怕只有一句晚安。\nletter2_story=夹在图书馆借阅的《荒原》里，一张褪色的明信片背面写着这段话。\n[/状态栏]"
}